  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dutch Moroccan Water Days</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 2nd Edition Dutch Moroccan Water Days (DMWD) will ensure strategic collaboration between Dutch and Moroccan water stakeholders through guaranteeing an interactive platform with linkage to the World Water Congress 2025 in Marrakech. The project encourages dialogue on water innovation, offers a platform for knowledge exchange, fosters sustainable practice, and creates linkages between different water businesses.By connecting public and private stakeholders, startups, researchers, and policymakers, this program assists in improving water governance, climate resilience, and inclusive economic development. It adds to the Moroccan national water strategy and reiterates the pattern of bilateral partnership established under the 2023 Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) between Morocco and the Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
